Usage: berth worktree unlock [options] [identifier]

clear a dead holder's lock on a worktree, the registry, or the router, once the
holder, and anything it left running, is checked gone

Options:
  --domain <domain>      narrow a slug registered under more than one domain
  --registry             clear the machine-wide worktree registry lock instead
                         of a worktree's
  --router               clear the shared router's lock instead of a worktree's
  --holder-unverifiable  accept a holder this machine cannot check (another
                         machine or container, or no record), once you have made
                         sure it is gone
  -h, --help             display help for command
